            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "christylynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I just made this today and it was a hit. Great served warm with whipped topping. I used 2 tsp. pumpkin pie spice in place of the spices they suggested. Will make again!",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-01T17:37:50.827Z"
